{"change_summary":"Inspected the two pending amendments against current HEAD, then fixed both: `TankSnapshotRepr::co2_aq_mmol_per_l` now uses `#[serde(default)]` so pre-field snapshot payloads deserialize as `0.0`, with a dedicated regression test, and the `tank_harness` non-finite envelope regression now exercises `water_temp_c`, which actually survives into `TankSnapshot`, instead of recomputed pH.","outstanding_risks":["`cargo test -p tank_core --lib` still fails in the unrelated existing unit test `systems::shrimp::tests::update_condition_treats_full_accessible_ration_as_satiated` at `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs:1008`; this is outside the snapshot/harness amendment scope.","The worktree still contains unrelated existing changes in `crates/tank_core/tests/plant_algae_integration.rs` and untracked `.ralph-burning/` artifacts; they were left untouched.","I did not rerun the full workspace or untouched crate suites (`tank_api`, `tank_tui`) because the remediation was isolated to `tank_core` snapshot deserialization and `tank_harness` unit coverage."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected `crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` and `crates/tank_harness/src/lib.rs` to verify the pending amendments against the current implementation.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added backward-compatible deserialization for missing `co2_aq_mmol_per_l` on `TankSnapshotRepr` and added a regression test covering legacy snapshot payloads that omit the field.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Reworked `envelope_reports_non_finite_values` to assert a non-finite `temperature_c` path that is copied through `TankSnapshot`, replacing the impossible pH-based expectation.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran targeted formatting and validation on the touched snapshot and harness paths, and recorded the remaining unrelated `tank_core` lib-suite failure.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`rustfmt --edition 2021 crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs crates/tank_harness/src/lib.rs` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_core snapshot_deserializes_payloads_missing_co2_field --lib` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core types::snapshot::tests --lib` passed (7 tests), including legacy alias, canonical-precedence, pre-stage-total, and missing-CO2 compatibility coverage.","`cargo test -p tank_harness --lib` passed (4 tests), including the corrected `envelope_reports_non_finite_values` regression.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib` failed only in the unrelated existing test `systems::shrimp::tests::update_condition_treats_full_accessible_ration_as_satiated` (`crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs:1008`)."]}